        "end": 22,
        "start": 22
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The majority also misses the mark when it asserts that it is \u201csubstantially likely that the [district attorney] would abide by [Reed's requested] court order.\u201d Ante, at 234 (internal quotation marks omitted)."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2022-21-442",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "4cde8b7a5790b7038bf86d6952cd768906229c29b03a68b057ccb18c19a8d28f",
      "evidence_id": "ev-4cde8b7a5790-0003-0001",
