      "opinion_part": "dissent",
      "pages": {
        "end": 35,
        "start": 35
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "While that event may have \u201cconcentrate[d] his mind wonderfully,\u201d that is not an excuse for the basic mistake of missing a statute of limitations."
